{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "a728934be01f5f39ffc32a2f69a9eaf4dc44637330d65657e280dccd7dd219ee", "ja": "せーふく、かんりょー？", "zh": "制服，完毕～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d507a8f1bcca670671003febbfab311d6c91555d28df2c96e6dbacc8af604ba5", "ja": "特別番組に先んじて行われた劇場のライブは\n大盛況。ステージから戻って来たメンバー達\nは、観客席に雪歩がいたと話すが、雪歩は別\nのロケに出かけているはず……？　首をかし\nげるプロデューサーなのだった。", "zh": "特别节目前举行的剧场演出大获成功。回到后台的成员们说在观众席看到了雪步，可雪步应该去了别的外景拍摄……？制作人不禁歪头疑惑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "baebb35cd2246822c96b0115605e324a755a16c049404e63cee64e08ca1a7912", "ja": "（特別版『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』の\n放送に先んじて、劇場でのライブが行われた！）", "zh": "（在特别节目《☆噼啪星球☆》播出前，剧场还举办了现场演出！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5ed20456397cc3b21ca8e6f9b981570d1f7ed5a351830fa7ba0c0ee0672acfb5", "ja": "（ライブは大盛況！　いい感じに\n宣伝にもなったし、相乗効果が期待できそうだ）", "zh": "（演唱会大获成功！也顺利起到了宣传作用，看样子可以期待一下相乘效果了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "44d7f1d976e2afdd2bae6501660729ae1f1214f9e1fbdac9251e8c65ae44f0d5", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！　久しぶりだったけど、\nばっちり宇宙人だったぞ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！虽然好久没见，但大家都完美地像外星人一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "d9b8a9f6ffaf9e23d8f86424c9355d4322ce52abef8b0af0ef09c0761ea7343a", "ja": "おやぶん！　そんなの当然だぞ～♪\nたまきたち、ミリオン星人なんだからね！", "zh": "老大！那是当然的啦～♪\n玉树她们可是百万星人嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "761cf4b983674f3ba839c853adbd0315fcca78016b5e635fc86e4b77512ccc3f", "ja": "ん……。\n杏奈達、スペースアイドル……だから。", "zh": "嗯……\n因为杏奈她们……是宇宙偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "d4fc72c2483185142de7d31be369ffde0a6e005db32b1082f74b258310653f01", "ja": "ひさしぶりにミリオン星人になれて\nすごく楽しかったねぇ。", "zh": "时隔许久又能成为百万星人，真的特别开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "f41289570dd6666b84112dc329e51b6d80540124fc8f51b6f58b4b13f7af0e77", "ja": "お客さんもいつものファンのみんなも、\n子どもたちも見に来てくれて……。", "zh": "客人和往常支持我们的粉丝们，还有孩子们也都来看了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "7842a4fda875d1eae4ab22565a7dd780ef23605c4b30d121d83630c6d824c3bc", "ja": "あと雪歩お姉ちゃんも！", "zh": "还有雪步姐姐也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "64a7373d59856863b0ba065d830cdd2fcc81c69e4733232c1a1f645601bb8dc5", "ja": "そうそう、わたしも見えました！　雪歩さん、\nコンサートライトを振って応援してくれてましたよね♪", "zh": "对对，我也看到了！雪步姐姐，您一直挥着演唱会荧光棒为我们加油，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "23bd2383a2a668b557dae132ee9300ffaeacff22120032d36ab827492a88ca25", "ja": "え？　雪歩？", "zh": "咦？雪步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "c29c657e5da65e6733b8af2eb5de26623b3da95a1ff654d7dc3faa8e0d804de2", "ja": "はい、観客席に。舞台の上から見えました。", "zh": "是的，她在观众席上。我从舞台上看到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "391ffb189c824324d4fae779ca5528be7a7eb884407b1162f25ce7473886298e", "ja": "すっごく……目立ってた……よ……。", "zh": "特别……显眼……哦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f9b2bfab90c49fdc41a81c7b2a44f3e3ea90940a812bfa6e627121a6d5f03816", "ja": "いや、雪歩は今、\n別のロケに出かけてるはずだけど……？", "zh": "不对啊，雪步现在\n应该在出别处的外景才对……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "5af4deeaba99d9da190091e684a19a4e49e77828e14852711235a5e07850332f", "ja": "あれ？　じゃあ、\n急いで帰ってきてくれたのかな？", "zh": "哎？那她是\n特意赶回来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "602228c4399f167f25f4cabe56ad26d2e80d838f04959478921841a608e391f0", "ja": "（そういえば前の撮影のときにも、\n雪歩が分裂してたよな……）", "zh": "说起来，上次拍摄时雪步也分裂过来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "df272ec1e8a9b902b5aec4a5c6c271ed6a09b0d560f4fd63fb87dbcbed3897c3", "ja": "みんなの、メッセージプレート……\n本当に宇宙人に届いたかもしれないな。", "zh": "大家的留言牌……\n说不定真的传到外星人那里去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "c4ae2027dbb25b0c0983b70a0248fc0f8cbdfa441d223f5920628ea899934e21", "ja": "え？　おやぶん、それ本当？　だったら嬉しいな～♪\nお返事待ってるねって、伝えておいてね！", "zh": "诶？老大，是真的吗？那样的话我会很开心的～♪\n要告诉他们，我们等着他们的回信哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "a50c3e9c7931da70e461ec128a8fd62b45ac3bc30fe9262ee0b6cd850fb908a2", "ja": "あ、そうそう！　最後はわたし達らしく、\nアレをやらなきゃいけませんよ！", "zh": "啊，对了对了！最后还得做那个，才像我们嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "68e392d6c5d0f3262073de89da798e84889b3581a7462f9becd68d7b239589eb", "ja": "そう……アレ、やらなくちゃ……。", "zh": "对……那个，得做才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0f52e051a4f9e8cfba7d903aea842e5b630d597704fee4dcfdc807e08ef5fd8e", "ja": "アレ？", "zh": "哎呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "a585a1e62e4dde6f980555c522028bc28dbc32c24d2edbf3a718de4385c5c089", "ja": "ふふふ♪　せーのっ。", "zh": "呵呵呵♪　预备——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "cdd6d74e14d0981cb2df81828b4d924d70777d8f2c704633f753dd11ee286130", "ja": "せーふく、かんりょー！！", "zh": "征服，完成──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "cdd6d74e14d0981cb2df81828b4d924d70777d8f2c704633f753dd11ee286130", "ja": "せーふく、かんりょー！！", "zh": "征服，完成──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "cdd6d74e14d0981cb2df81828b4d924d70777d8f2c704633f753dd11ee286130", "ja": "せーふく、かんりょー！！", "zh": "征服，完成──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "cdd6d74e14d0981cb2df81828b4d924d70777d8f2c704633f753dd11ee286130", "ja": "せーふく、かんりょー！！", "zh": "征服，完成──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "4ed064c9633cfcf055016143862b0856e5217274cd9317e8dffa8b1e156c371b", "ja": "（広大な宇宙空間では、人類には想像もできない\n現象が、今も起こっているのかもしれない……）", "zh": "（在浩瀚的宇宙空间中，或许至今仍有一些人类无法想象的现象正在发生……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "927e7dd12a141d83dac4e24e407fc62c31ec232deb14d310340575a016c585d9", "ja": "（ミリオン星人の『せーふく』は、思いも\nしないところまで広がっているのかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（百万星人的“征服”，也许已经扩展到意想不到的地方了啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
